An '''Ananke Feather''' is a {{Rare}} item.

== Obtaining ==
=== Kuudra ===
An '''Ananke Feather''' has a {{Chance|0.27%|1|369.95|runs}} chance of being obtained from an [[Infernal Kuudra]] run's paid reward chest.

The chance of dropping an '''Ananke Feather''' can be increased by {{Green|2%}}–{{Green|20%}} through levelling up the {{Attr|Wings of Destiny}} by syphoning {{Item|Ananke Shard}}s.

=== Salvaging Godrolls ===
'''Ananke Feathers''' can also be obtained by salvaging legacy greyed out attributes from certain items with specific attribute combinations at {{NPCSprite|Salvage Old Attributes}} or in {{Code|/attributemenu}}.

