== Usage ==
An '''Ananke Feather''' can be used to grant progress towards an [[RNG Meter|{{Pink|{{Abbr|RNG|Random Number Generator}} Meter}}]] of the player's choice. The progress granted is unaffected by the {{Attribute|Pity}} attribute ({{Item|Daemon Shard}}).

